# Docker files (local only - not tracked)
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml

# The 3CP specification is canon and lives at github.com/had-nu/3CP. It is NOT vendored
# here: a second copy drifts from the first, and a stale copy is worse than none — the
# two language versions already disagree (§2, §4, §6), so reading the wrong one silently
# yields a wrong citation. Fetch it instead; see docs/3CP-CONFORMANCE.md.
.3cp/
